  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A fish you can catch. msm:bucketable lets a player use a water bucket on it: the minnow goes into the bucket item msm_examples:pond_minnow_bucket (\"Bucket of Pond Minnow\", made for you, stacking to 1), which keeps its name and health and lets it out again with the water. It has no bucket_texture, so the bucket is drawn as vanilla's water bucket. Only swimmers (mode swim) can be caught. play_dead makes it lie still and heal for 200 ticks when a hit leaves it below half its health, as an axolotl. It spawns in rivers in schools of three to five.",
